1. bump_wrong  -> NoMethodError: undefined method '+' for nil
   (count = count + 1 makes count a local for the whole method, so the right-hand count is that local, nil)
2. bump_right  -> 1 (self.count += 1 reads through the reader and writes through the setter)
3. bump_ivar   -> 2 (@count += 1 skips both)
4. read_bare   -> 2 (a bare read still reaches the reader)
5. c.count     -> 2
